<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Fiachnae mac Demmáin</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 627</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Fiachnae mac Demmáin was a king of the Dál Fiatach and of the Ulaid in the early 7th century. He contested the overkingship of the Ulaid with his namesake <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fiachnae-mac-baetain">Fiachnae mac Báetáin</a> of the Dál nAraidi, whom he defeated and killed in 626, and he was himself killed in battle the following year.</p></div>
